msgid "Boarding location"
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:367 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:399
msgid ""
"This program includes a brief stop by the beach to dive whenever be possible."
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:371 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:403
msgid ""
"Experience the breathtaking beauty of Portugal's stunning Algarve coastline "
"on this tour. The boarding is done in Carvoeiro, we provide transport to "
"Ferragudo to start the tour."
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:375 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:407
msgid ""
"We are a team of professionals, passionate about the sea, who are dedicated "
"to their work to make your trip a unique and unforgettable moment!"
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:379 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:411
msgid ""
"The trip will start heading to the dolphins habitat and on the way back we "
"visit Praia da Marinha, Algar de Benagil, Olhos de Deus, the largest cave in "
"the Algarve, and much more."
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:383 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:415
msgid ""
"Our professionals like to share their extensive knowledge about the region, "
"as well as marine life, and the local ecosystem, ensuring that all our "
"passengers can fully understand and appreciate the wonderful marine life."
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:387 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:419
msgid "Health & Safety"
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:389 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:421
msgid ""
"We do not recommend the speed boat tour to people with serious back "
"problems, or weighing more than 120kg and pregnant women in late stages of "
"pregnancy."
msgstr ""

